error[E0180]: 'Membership' has no single primary key for 'Repo<Membership>.find'
  --> check_orm_repo_composite_find_delete.bit:21:11
   |
21 |   members.find(1)?
   |           ^^^^ it carries a composite key (more than one '@id' field) — Repo<T>.find takes one id and cannot match a composite key; only 'update' and 'save' match every '@id' field
